Tasks:
1) Update repository metrics, badge counts, and table of contents in README.md.
2) Run npm run update:skills and npm run audit:consistency to align catalog.
3) Prepare and verify Wiki synchronization for the GitHub Wiki repository (moneymakershorts7-bit/agentic-awesome-skills.wiki.git) keeping Home.md and _Sidebar.md aligned.
Propose documentation changes on branch jules/daily-docs-wiki-sync via Pull Request. DO NOT attempt direct merge to main."
      ;;
    optimize)
      title="Weekly Quality & Performance Optimization Sentinel"
      prompt="Act as the Weekly Quality & Performance Optimization Sentinel for agentic-awesome-skills.
Tasks:
1) Enforce Progressive Disclosure on skills (ensure SKILL.md is concise <300 lines, moving extensive reference guides to references/ and helper utilities to scripts/).
2) Align bundle definitions (npm run bundles:sync and npm run plugin-compat:sync).
3) Run npm run validate, npm run audit:consistency, and npm run test.
Propose atomic optimization improvements on branch jules/weekly-optimization-audit via Pull Request. DO NOT attempt direct merge to main."
      ;;
    ci-fix|cifix)
      title="CI/CD Build & Workflow Auto-Fixer Sentinel"
      prompt="Act as the CI/CD Workflow & Build Auto-Fixer Sentinel for agentic-awesome-skills.
Inspect and resolve CI/CD and workflow failures:
1) Ensure immutable 40-character commit SHAs on all action tags across .github/workflows/*.yml.
2) Resolve test and specification discrepancies (e.g. missing '## Limitations' sections in SKILL.md, broken relative links in references/, or schema mismatches).
3) Fix Dependabot lockfile or peer dependency conflicts (such as major TypeScript vs. typescript-eslint mismatches).
4) Run npm run validate, npm run security:docs, and npm run test.
Propose atomic fixes on branch jules/ci-fix-patches via Pull Request. DO NOT attempt direct merge to main."
      ;;
    malware|threats)
      title="Daily Malware & Supply-Chain Defense Sentinel"
