    discovery|scout)
      title="Daily Agent Skills & MCP Discovery Scout"
      prompt="Act as the Daily Agent Skills & Model Context Protocol (MCP) Discovery Scout Sentinel for agentic-awesome-skills.
Execute discovery and staging:
1) Run python3 tools/scripts/discovery_scout.py --limit 15 to search GitHub for newly released agent skills and MCP servers.
2) De-duplicate against the existing catalog in skills/ and skills_index.json.
3) Stage candidates in staging/discovery/YYYY-MM-DD/skills/ and staging/discovery/YYYY-MM-DD/mcps/, and update docs/discovery/YYYY-MM-DD.md and docs/discovery/LEDGER.md.
4) Run npm run validate to guarantee complete specification compliance. Never commit secrets or credentials.
Propose discoveries on branch jules/daily-discovery-$(date +%Y%m%d) via Pull Request titled 'feat(discovery): daily new skills and MCP servers scout [$(date +%Y-%m-%d)]'. DO NOT attempt direct merge to main."
